# FLAGS-ARCHIVE — Resolved Review History

Append-only archive of flags that went through `/review-flags` and got resolved (APPLIED or DISMISSED). Deferred flags stay in `FLAGS.md` with a `DEFERRED` annotation.

Every entry keeps the original flag content plus a `RESOLVED` line with date, outcome, and rationale. For queryable decision history, also see `kb entity flag-review` — this file is the narrative record, the KB is the structured one.

